╭─ Issue description ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Issue Title: fix(tool): drop the read cache when a tool call block is evicted during context compression                                        │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Description:                                                                                                                                    │
│ **Background**                                                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ Currently, `Write` and `Edit` tools are coupled with `Read` — a file must be read before it can be modified. This read result is cached on the  │
│ corresponding `Read` tool call block to facilitate the validation.                                                                              │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ However, during context compression, when a `Read` tool call block is evicted from the context, its associated cache is not cleared. Over time, │
│ this causes the cache to grow unboundedly, leading to unnecessary memory consumption.                                                           │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ **Changes**                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
│ - During context compression, explicitly identify evicted `Read` tool call blocks and clear their associated cache                              │
│ - This ensures the cache lifecycle is tied to the corresponding tool call block's presence in the context, preventing unbounded cache growth    │
╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
